	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["6F62B5510FA881CD"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>树的根</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>左侧槽位放入注入材料，右侧槽位放入物品，机器会将两者融合。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>煤炭或木炭会变成 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>碳粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。红石会变成 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>红石粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。钻石、精炼黑曜石和金矿也各有不同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>从这里开始建造的一切都需要这台机器制造的东西，所以把它放在容易到达的地方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你将最先制作的东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>富含铁和碳的富铁钢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>钢粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>由富铁和更多碳制成。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>Infused Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 由铁和红石制成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 充能缓冲器在配方之间保持加载，因此一组煤炭可以支持非常长的运行时间。"
			]
			id: "162CE44400A63575"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "52FEA6D9C1258DA8"
					item: "minecraft:redstone"
					random_bonus: 2
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "52912755CBA30A4D"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 10
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#3FA9C8>一切始于此处</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "28277BA9F319240D"
				item: "mekanism:metallurgic_infuser"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6>冶金催化器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["162CE44400A63575"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>复制机</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>给它喂食矿石块，你会得到 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>2 粉尘</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。喂食脏粉尘，你会得到干净的粉尘。喂食红石，你会得到 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>富集红石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这台机器位于模组中每个矿石链的末端，所以你最终会拥有好几台。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它还能把压缩的物品变回散装，用处比你想象的要多得多。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "08DDE018A804BFE7"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "4DF8BB733E3987AA"
					item: "minecraft:raw_iron"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "5F32C9EFEDDA78E5"
