		{
			dependencies: ["7778937DF377C1B4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>储存能量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>4,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，每刻推出去 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>4,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的力。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还能给扔进去的任何物品充电，在没有充能台之前，这是最简单的保持工具满电的方法。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>每个更高等级都会将这两个数字乘以四。</grad></shadow>"
			]
