		{
			dependencies: ["3AACA62471C6A4B3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第三锭锭</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个矿石块和 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>1个氧气 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会给你 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>3个簇 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。碎片也可以放进去，会变成一个簇出来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>氧气来自电解分离器，这意味着这台机器需要在其后方供水，而不仅仅是电源线。</grad></shadow>"
