		{
			dependencies: ["08DDE018A804BFE7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>不再产煤</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用能量代替燃料，熔炼熔炉能熔炼的任何东西。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要升级，需要工厂改造，而且再也不会向你索要木炭了。</grad></shadow>"
