		{
			dependencies: ["3AACA62471C6A4B3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>氢和氧</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>倒入水，它就会分解成</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>氢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>氧</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>氧气驱动净化室。氢气为你的喷气背包供能，为燃气燃烧发电机供能，并随后转化为氯化氢。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 两个储罐都会充满。如果一侧溢出，机器会停止，所以请将不需要的燃气排放或管道输送。"
			]
			id: "18D88932916C7A98"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "58B361AC94AEB36D"
					item: "mekanism:alloy_infused"
					random_bonus: 1
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0C296148AF479F71"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 10
				}
			]
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#7FE0B0>水，但要分成两部分</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "054CC6FB5173F8A3"
				item: "mekanism:electrolytic_separator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6>电解分离器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 14.5d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6CD1720B76F47806"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>氢气和乙烯</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可燃烧任何可燃气体，并储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>18,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的气体量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>电解分离器运行后，氢气几乎免费，而且实用。 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>乙烯</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>才是真正的宝藏，每单位燃烧可产生 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>40</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刻的持续时间。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>乙烯在加压反应室中由生物燃料、氢和水制成，这意味着一个足够大的农场可以成为一个真正的发电厂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 这就是将大多数玩家带到裂变反应堆的发电机。"
			]
			id: "3EC9D0DA61B45328"
			rewards: [
				{
