		{
			dependencies: ["27456841F48DF7C3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>气体混合</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将两种气体结合成第三种气体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>氢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>氯</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生成氯化氢，可解锁4倍矿石加工。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>二氧化硫</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>氧气</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生成三氧化硫。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>三氧化硫</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 加上 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>水蒸气</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生成硫酸，解锁 5x 配方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>之后它会为反应堆制造六氟化铀，所以这台机器永远不会真正退役。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "04E2D539E33B7B0F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "576766449D68D6D4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#7FE0B0>气体加气体等于气体</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "31D203EC92BEA66F"
				item: "mekanism:chemical_infuser"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6>化学注入器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 21.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6CF26D1345B796EF"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造塔楼</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>由Thermal Evaporation Block组成的多方块结构，高度至少为</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>3</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>层，最高可达</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>18</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>层，顶部边缘有控制器，阀门可安装在任意连接处。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>水从顶部进入，卤水从底部流出。将卤水再通入其中，就能得到</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>锂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>让它真正发挥作用</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塔只有在发热时才会生产，并且会自行每秒损失 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>0.02</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的热量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部每块 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>太阳能电池板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会增加 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>0.2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的热量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每一层高度都会增加 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的热容量，这意味着更高的塔升温更慢，但一旦升温后会更稳定。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- 通过导体用 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>燃料木加热器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 或 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>电阻加热器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 为其供暖也行，夜间同样有效。"
				""
				"[!tip] 盐水是获取盐、钠、氯和锂的来源。这些元素后期都是瓶颈，所以把塔建得比你需要的大。"
			]
			id: "603877AB96321F1A"
