		{
			dependencies: ["6CF26D1345B796EF"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>泥浆混合物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个矿石块加上 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>1 硫酸，会溶解成 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>1000 份 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>脏浆料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>矿浆并非物品。它会像其他化学物质一样在加压管道中流动，这使得最后一段矿石加工的管道铺设出乎意料地整洁。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还将萤石溶解成氢氟酸，这是整个核链的第一步。</grad></shadow>"
