		{
			dependencies: ["0650996C7818ADB5"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>阳光</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒消耗 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>50</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，并储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>96,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它没什么大用。但它永远不需要喂食，永远不会耗尽，也永远不会爆炸，这在研究模组时还是挺有用的。</grad></shadow>"
			]
