		{
			dependencies: ["6F62B5510FA881CD"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你的第一股力量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒消耗燃料产生 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>200</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，加入岩浆后效果更佳。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与熔岩接触的每个面每秒增加 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>30</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在末地坐着的另一个好处是 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它本身就能储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>160,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用岩浆淹没它算作第七个面，所以下界中一个完全被包围的发电机，绝对算得上是早期相当不错的电源了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 十个熔岩块等于一次燃烧。用管道导入熔岩即可自动流动。"
			]
