		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0650996C7818ADB5"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>生物燃料</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒产生 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>350</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，并可储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>24</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 桶生物燃料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生物燃料来自破碎机，而破碎机可以处理几乎所有植物，所以农场和破碎机组合起来就能凭空产生能源。</grad></shadow>"
			]
