		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0650996C7818ADB5"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>海拔很重要</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>输出随高度变化，从底部每刻 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>60</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，到顶部最高可达 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>480</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Y 值以下无事发生，</grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>24</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。再往上就稳步上升了，所以你屋顶上那座丑塔确实在干活。></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>雨和雷声将其推得更高了些。</grad></shadow>"
			]
