			x: 0.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["08DDE018A804BFE7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三种输入，两种输出</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>唯一一种同时消耗物品、流体和气体，并产出物品和气体的机器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生物燃料、水和氢气构成</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>基质</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>基质、水和乙烯可制成 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>聚乙烯颗粒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>很久以后，它将钚和钋制成颗粒。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 这也是 {ethylene} 的来源，而乙烯是燃气发电机能使用的最佳燃料。"
			]
