		{
			dependencies: ["162CE44400A63575"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你最常用的工具</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键机器面可循环切换该面的功能。Shift+右键可旋转方块。指向电缆可查看网络。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还有一种模式可以清空机器的物品栏，以及将方块拆解为其物品形式的模式。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 几乎所有Mekanism的问题都源于侧边设置错误了颜色。解决方法如下。"
			]
			id: "6204FD44E430A012"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#C8AE86>你最常用的工具</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "45939EA9569BB1FB"
				item: "mekanism:configurator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>配置器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6204FD44E430A012"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>采石场</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>设定半径，告诉它要找什么，它就会把那些方块从地里挖出来递给你。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>向每个方向延伸最多 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>32</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>升级前每块需要 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>80</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刻。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>丝绸之触模式消耗的能量是普通模式的 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>12</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 倍。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>过滤器支持物品名、标签和模组名，这样过滤一个区块里的所有矿石只需一个过滤器，而不是二十个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 速度升级在这里非常重要。未升级的矿工慢得令人痛苦。"
			]
			id: "6265139131AA0385"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#3FA9C8>无需挖掘的采矿法</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "06A35F876D009E57"
				item: "mekanism:digital_miner"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6>数字矿工</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.0d
