		{
			dependencies: ["1F031D0DE9CE502C"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>帧与频率</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>建造框架，放入传送器方块，设置频率，任何同频的传送器都会成为目的地。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它在不同维度间都能使用。能量消耗随距离增加，跨维度旅行成本高昂。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			id: "255BC3CDB0096E69"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#3FA9C8>踏入其中，抵达彼方</grad>"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "7D0F00B863A3832B"
					item: "mekanism:teleporter"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
