			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6>传送器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.4d
			y: 8.3d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F031D0DE9CE502C"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一格方块，无限距离</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>处于同一频率的两个装置会共享内容，无论相隔多远或在哪个维度中。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能传输物品、流体、化学物质、热量和能量。能量传输上限为每个频率 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>256,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，与终极能量立方相同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 这就是在不拉一根线缆的情况下，为远程采矿前哨站供电的方法。"
			]
			id: "64AFD9DC66E5484F"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#3FA9C8>电缆是胆小鬼用的</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "758D949BEB2708F7"
