			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6>量子纠缠传送器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.4d
			y: 8.3d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6265139131AA0385"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四种材料，一个核心</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>黄金、钻石、末影珍珠和精炼黑曜石，用原子合金粘合在一起。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>模组里的每个传送器、便携式传送器、纠缠传送器和QIO方块都需要一个这个。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1F031D0DE9CE502C"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#3FA9C8>昂贵的部分</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6C89B0FE18FDACFF"
