			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6>传送核心</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6204FD44E430A012"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>多方块窗户</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可作为动态储罐、锅炉、感应矩阵、SPS和蒸发塔的合法墙体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>纯粹是为了让你能观看，而观看反应堆确实很有用。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "3881B34C1F9773EC"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#9AA6B0>这样你就能观看了</grad>"
			tasks: [{
