		{
			dependencies: ["6265139131AA0385"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>镐、斧、铲子、剪刀、剑</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可挖掘任何方块，永不损坏，按按键切换速度模式。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在能量耗尽时造成额外伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>20</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 蓄力后每挥动一次造成额外伤害，蓄力 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>2,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量时生效。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>储存着 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>1,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它没有脉矿挖掘模式，所以你挥向什么，就能破坏什么。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它也是Meka-Tool的基础，所以不要把它扔掉。</grad></shadow>"
