		{
			dependencies: ["6204FD44E430A012"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>便携式万物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个小机器人，会跟随你，携带物品栏、合成台、熔炉和修理台。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它需要一个 </grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>Chargepad</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来生成和充电。给它命名，染上颜色，它就会永远跟着你转了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它还会捡起掉落物，但反击得很差劲。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5703872B3F5C2CD4"
			optional: true
			size: 1.0d
