		{
			dependencies: ["6204FD44E430A012"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造一个箱子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>任何由动态储罐方块组成的空心矩形，只要墙壁上至少有一个</grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>动态阀门</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，就会变成一个巨大的储罐。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>内部体积的每个方块可容纳 </grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>350</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>桶流体。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>或 </grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>16,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 单位的化学物质。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个不起眼的立方体里装着远超所需之物，结构玻璃也算作有效墙壁，让你能看清层级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 阀门既是输入也是输出。两端各一个是最常见的设置。"
