		}
		{
			dependencies: ["603877AB96321F1A"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>热量，而非力量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>燃烧普通熔炉燃料，每燃料刻产生 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>400</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 热量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在Mekanism中，热量是一个独立的概念。它通过热力学导体传输，并为蒸发塔和锅炉提供能量。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "783D70FEAC7A5099"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F2C14E to=#F2C14E>烧东西，取暖吧</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "47505C12FBEA5738"
