		{
			dependencies: ["58B125BD4876054C"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#4C9BD6 to=#C2E2FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Mekanism 掩埋之物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>五种矿石被添加到你的世界中，而且你几乎肯定已经走过了它们。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4C9BD6 to=#C2E2FF f=0.8>锇</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>才是关键。它从基岩到地表随处可见，是这里几乎所有机器的基础材料。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4C9BD6 to=#C2E2FF f=0.8>锡</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#4C9BD6 to=#C2E2FF f=0.8>铅</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>都是普通金属，一旦开始建造，用途会非常多。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4C9BD6 to=#C2E2FF f=0.8>萤石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 深埋地下，直到你搞核能前都用不着它。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4C9BD6 to=#C2E2FF f=0.8>铀</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 听起来有多友好，实际上就有多友好。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 每种各挖一个，任务就完成了。不需要一整个堆叠。"
			]
