			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6>翻倍</grad></shadow>"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"7AE502EDB73BD57A"
				"407EFAF528871014"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三机循环</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个矿石块加上 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>1个氧气</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在净化室中会产出 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>3个团块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。之后就是一个固定的小流水线了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>净化室</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将矿石转化为矿块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>破碎机</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将每个土块变成脏土粉。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>富集室</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将脏污的尘埃净化为真正的尘埃。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>熔炉将尘埃铸成锭。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的氧气来自电解分离器分解水，所以整个循环靠水和电力运行。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 用物流运输机把三台机器连起来，之后就再也不用管了。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:clump_iron"
			id: "27456841F48DF7C3"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 6
					id: "76ECB2067EC86AC6"
