			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6>三倍化</grad></shadow>"
			x: 18.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["04E2D539E33B7B0F"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>碎片</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在化学注射室中，一个矿石块加上1个氯化氢会生成4个碎片。碎片会沿着你已建造的链条返回去。"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>注射室</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会生成碎片。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>净化室</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将碎片变为簇。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>Crusher</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，然后是</grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>Enrichment Chamber</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，最后是熔炉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"氯化氢从化学注入器中产出，由电解分离器提供氢，由盐提供氯。"
				""
				"[!warn] 四层机器意味着四倍的功耗。在扩大规模前，先整理好你的发电机。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:shard_iron"
			id: "6CF26D1345B796EF"
			rewards: [
