		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"4AFF81D3D0E78255"
				"3999760881C855FA"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>五换一</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个矿石块加上 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>1 硫酸，会溶解成 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>1000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 脏浆料。清洗并结晶，每 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>200</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 浆料可得到 </grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>5 个晶体。"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>溶解室</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将矿石变为脏泥浆。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>化学清洗机</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用水将其冲洗干净。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>化学结晶器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将浆料冷冻成晶体。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>晶体经过注入、提纯、粉碎和富集，然后熔炼。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>为了一个锭子，要摆七台机器，不过自动化之后完全值得。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] Mekanism 中每种矿石最多产出五个锭。模组后续内容都无法超越。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>硫酸需要在化学催化器中使用二氧化硫和水，而二氧化硫是氧化硫粉尘。</grad></shadow>"
			]
