		{
			dependencies: ["3AACA62471C6A4B3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>矿石，重组版</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八块原矿加一块鹅卵石可以合成一个</grad><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.8>原矿块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，再次合成成功。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>听起来毫无意义，直到你想起上面每一步都优先选择原矿块而非原矿。八个原矿变成一个原矿块，而那个原矿块又能变成五个锭。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>如果你需要，它还能把砾石变成燧石。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:combiner"
			id: "2473777659DDB3DD"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "29E11E410B77C3D4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0A64A to=#E0A64A>开采矿石</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3086D52C58686DE5"
				item: "mekanism:combiner"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E0A64A to=#FFE0AC f=0.6>组合器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2473777659DDB3DD"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E9F1F8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>比你需要的木板还多</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一根原木能产出 </grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E9F1F8 f=0.8>6根木板，而一根木板能产出 </grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E9F1F8 f=0.8>4根木棍，而不是原来的四根和两根。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次切割都有几率掉落</grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E9F1F8 f=0.8>木屑</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可以压缩回木板。这样锯木厂就能把树场变成无尽的木材供应源了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:precision_sawmill"
