			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#AFC3D8>树木，但值得拥有</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "16983CA3C89B0783"
				item: "mekanism:precision_sawmill"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E9F1F8 f=0.6>精密锯木厂</grad></shadow>"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18D88932916C7A98"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>执行工作的部分</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>金、铁、锇、聚乙烯和富集红石围绕一桶水排列。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"核心位于电解分离器内，后来演变为电解呼吸单元，让你的头盔充满空气。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:electrolytic_core"
			id: "5F3BB1462241364E"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "727CE33F0811F25B"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#7FE0B0>起作用的部件</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1A2B4E98D0080E7F"
				item: "mekanism:electrolytic_core"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6>电解核心</grad></shadow>"
			x: 14.5d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["027084AE2DF5EBA6"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>氯气的来源</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在蒸发塔中煮沸盐水可得到盐。氧化盐可得到 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>钠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。将钠和氢气通入化学注入器，可得到 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>氯化氢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>那种气体能解锁4倍矿石处理，所以这堆不起眼的白色粉末比看上去重要得多。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:salt"
			id: "27DC39C421509A3D"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "69426789B36C00A7"
					item: "mekanism:salt"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "19E2BF092E8FC412"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 10
				}
			]
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#7FE0B0>给你的氯调味</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "165F2D740A9467C7"
				item: "mekanism:salt"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6>盐</grad></shadow>"
			x: 26.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34E9C8F27DFC0865"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>停止建造机器阵列</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>打开任意机器，角落处有一个升级槽。大多数机器总共需要 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>8</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个升级，可以自行分配。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>速度升级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 使其跑得更快，消耗更多能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>能量升级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 使其存储更多，消耗更少。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>气体升级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 决定了每单位气体能覆盖的距离。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>过滤升级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 使电动泵能将重水从普通水中抽出。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>消音升级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>让机器安静下来。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>锚点升级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 保持区块加载。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全升级的机器运行速度是其基础速度的</grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>10倍，因此一个升级后的富集室可以取代一整面墙的普通富集室。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 速度和能量升级通常是标准搭配。纯速度升级会比你想象的更快耗尽你的电网。"
			]
