				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将配方写入</grad><grad from=#3FA9C8 to=#B4EAF7 f=0.8>配方表</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，放入配方后，只要材料不断供应，机器就会无限制造该物品。</grad></shadow>"
