		{
			dependencies: ["46582374BD24C805"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>能量光束</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>激光沿直线发射能量，最远可达 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>64</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格。所经之处，物体要么受到伤害，要么被挖掘掉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>激光放大器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会储存光束，并在你设定的阈值下将其发射回去。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>Laser Tractor Beam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 效果相同，但会将所有掉落物品直接吸入自身物品栏。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>破坏方块需要消耗硬度每点 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>100,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，攻击生物则需要每半颗心消耗 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>2,500</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>聚变反应堆由激光点燃，所以这不仅仅是个玩具。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:laser"
