		{
			dependencies: ["6204FD44E430A012"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一次性设置</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击已配置过的机器以复制其设置，然后右键点击其他机器以粘贴。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>侧面、过滤器、自动弹出、红石模式，所有功能都清晰呈现。</grad></shadow>"
			]
